{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Pathless Maze&quot;</strong> is a maze-type tower defense game. In the combat map, you can build defense towers anywhere except on the monsters' designated path nodes. Monsters will follow the shortest path through these nodes until they escape at the endpoint. Defense towers not only attack monsters but also act as obstacles to alter their path, creating a dynamic maze.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tower Construction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before monsters invade, you can select empty spaces to build defense towers. Each construction attempt randomly generates an unlocked tower type, and the number of towers you can build per round varies by game mode. For example:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636800/extras/23a281ca923ed5a89604fc0c94ea847f.avif?t=1752195530\" width=616 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach the round's build limit, select <strong>one tower to keep</strong>, while the rest turn into obstacles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636800/extras/bccf8b46e99bfc0b61947a898b2a0fa6.avif?t=1752195530\" width=616 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters will then begin their invasion, and combat starts...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tower Synthesis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During construction, you might luckily encounter <strong>combinable towers</strong> in a single round:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636800/extras/f8fe1cbf76994d863cd4027d8620af3c.avif?t=1752195530\" width=500 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly select one tower to <strong>synthesize</strong>! The chosen tower becomes a synthesized tower, while the others turn into obstacles. Synthesized towers far surpass basic towers in damage and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If luck isn\u2019t on your side, you can still synthesize towers over multiple rounds by preserving specific ones:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636800/extras/b2bfcb840c811ddc6d24be9a3fec369e.avif?t=1752195530\" width=616 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always prioritize <strong>synthesis formulas</strong> when deciding which towers to retain each round!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One Step Further!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636800/474f4a48df8570543275d29baeee6e097e95194f.jpg"},{"name":"Two Steps Further!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636800/4195cc8a5119655e8cbfebe42b3f737525816a6c.jpg"},{"name":"Breakthrough In - Place!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636800/32703b9a549a6242a2e55a48d6fa69cec0837058.jpg"},{"name":"Seek Victory Steadily!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636800/90624294616eeb65d8dd5bbe3c4b13d3009c5ec2.jpg"},{"name":"Personalized Customization","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636800/07e85895649fae2c308dae6dbb87f2998d443dfa.jpg"},{"name":"Survey Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636800/1f5ff01586b6f076bce8155d545b33761bb635b6.jpg"},{"name":"Survey Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636800/ced429f5e760eb4d99724698b0b7265840e506bc.jpg"},{"name":"Signs Appear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636800/b8d8f844e492c48f75ce8133d14f756258f5d1c7.jpg"},{"name":"Solid Defense Line","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636800/12d6afb953ca5400cf209342424833d084c942a6.jpg"},{"name":"Pathless Maze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636800/655162161202fe3758493ba33d70eb73b4765ba4.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636800?t=1752195530","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636800?t=1752195530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636800/04f90e05e0d70fd0b3650772fe6581f6358ca0b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752195530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636800/04f90e05e0d70fd0b3650772fe6581f6358ca0b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752195530","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Pathless Maze&quot;</strong> is a maze-type tower defense game. In the combat map, you can build defense towers anywhere except on the monsters' designated path nodes. Monsters will follow the shortest path through these nodes until they escape at the endpoint. Defense towers not only attack monsters but also act as obstacles to alter their path, creating a dynamic maze.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tower Construction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before monsters invade, you can select empty spaces to build defense towers. Each construction attempt randomly generates an unlocked tower type, and the number 